        "url": "https://www.bbc.com/news/blogs-the-papers-60370885",
        "title": "Newspaper headlines: &apos;Final push&apos; to avert Ukraine invasion amid war fears",
        "content": "<html><body><div class=\"ssrcss-18mjolk-componentwrapper e1xue1i89\" data-component=\"image-block\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-wpgbih-styledfigure e34k3c23\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-styledfigurecontainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1ix1qms-placeholder e16icw910\"><span><img alt=\"1px transparent line\" class=\"ssrcss-1drmwog-image ee0ct7c0\" height=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/4BEB/production/_112953491__108802839_624_transparent-nc.png\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/4BEB/production/_112953491__108802839_624_transparent-nc.png 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/4BEB/production/_112953491__108802839_624_transparent-nc.png 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/4BEB/production/_112953491__108802839_624_transparent-nc.png 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/4BEB/production/_112953491__108802839_624_transparent-nc.png 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/4BEB/production/_112953491__108802839_624_transparent-nc.png 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/4BEB/production/_112953491__108802839_624_transparent-nc.png 976w\" width=\"624\"/></span></span></div></figure></div><div class=\"ssrcss-18mjolk-componentwrapper e1xue1i89\" data-component=\"image-block\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-wpgbih-styledfigure e34k3c23\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-styledfigurecontainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1rgapwy-placeholder e16icw910\"><span><img alt=\"The Daily Telegraph front page 14 February 2022\" class=\"ssrcss-1drmwog-image ee0ct7c0\" height=\"1568\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/55AE/production/_123243912_tele-nc.png\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/55AE/production/_123243912_tele-nc.png 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/55AE/production/_123243912_tele-nc.png 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/55AE/production/_123243912_tele-nc.png 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/55AE/production/_123243912_tele-nc.png 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/55AE/production/_123243912_tele-nc.png 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/55AE/production/_123243912_tele-nc.png 976w\" width=\"976\"/></span></span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-5ccyy0-styledfigurecaption e34k3c22\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1f39n02-visuallyhidden e1y6uwnp0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-1yybcoc-stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\">The main images across several of Monday&apos;s front pages are of civilians in Ukraine receiving combat training. On the Daily Telegraph, a 79-year-old woman is pictured holding a machine-gun during training organised by special forces. Its lead story centres on Boris Johnson urging Vladimir Putin to &quot;step back from the brink&quot; as he insists there is a &quot;window of opportunity&quot; to avoid war. The paper says the PM will start talking to world leaders on Monday and plans to travel to Europe later this week in a bid to unite Western allies.</div></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ssrcss-18mjolk-componentwrapper e1xue1i89\" data-component=\"image-block\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-wpgbih-styledfigure e34k3c23\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-styledfigurecontainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-9fe339-placeholder e16icw910\"><span><img alt=\"The i front page 14 February 2022\" class=\"ssrcss-1drmwog-image ee0ct7c0\" height=\"1288\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/7CBE/production/_123243913_the-i-nc.png\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/7CBE/production/_123243913_the-i-nc.png 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/7CBE/production/_123243913_the-i-nc.png 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/7CBE/production/_123243913_the-i-nc.png 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/7CBE/production/_123243913_the-i-nc.png 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/7CBE/production/_123243913_the-i-nc.png 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/7CBE/production/_123243913_the-i-nc.png 976w\" width=\"976\"/></span></span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-5ccyy0-styledfigurecaption e34k3c22\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1f39n02-visuallyhidden e1y6uwnp0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-1yybcoc-stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\">The i outlines attempts by the West to step up efforts to stop a Russian invasion of Ukraine. Up to 150,000 troops are now at the border, the paper says. Both the PM and foreign secretary will head to Europe this week to join allies in seeking a &quot;de-escalation&quot; of the situation, the paper adds.</div></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ssrcss-18mjolk-componentwrapper e1xue1i89\" data-component=\"image-block\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-wpgbih-styledfigure e34k3c23\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-styledfigurecontainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-ujv0ob-placeholder e16icw910\"><span><img alt=\"The Times front page 14 February 2022\" class=\"ssrcss-1drmwog-image ee0ct7c0\" height=\"1262\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/A3CE/production/_123243914_times-nc.png\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/A3CE/production/_123243914_times-nc.png 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/A3CE/production/_123243914_times-nc.png 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/A3CE/production/_123243914_times-nc.png 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/A3CE/production/_123243914_times-nc.png 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/A3CE/production/_123243914_times-nc.png 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/A3CE/production/_123243914_times-nc.png 976w\" width=\"976\"/></span></span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-5ccyy0-styledfigurecaption e34k3c22\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1f39n02-visuallyhidden e1y6uwnp0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-1yybcoc-stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\">The Times says diplomatic efforts to engage in talks are a &quot;final push&quot; to avert a Ukraine invasion. US President Joe Biden&apos;s senior security adviser has warned there could be &quot;major military action&quot; by the Kremlin &quot;very soon&quot;. However, the Kremlin has dismissed such warnings as &quot;hysteria&quot;.</div></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ssrcss-18mjolk-componentwrapper e1xue1i89\" data-component=\"image-block\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-wpgbih-styledfigure e34k3c23\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-styledfigurecontainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-rawpuk-placeholder e16icw910\"><span><img alt=\"The Daily Mirror front page 14 February 2022\" class=\"ssrcss-1drmwog-image ee0ct7c0\" height=\"1250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/80A6/production/_123243923_mirror-nc.png\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/80A6/production/_123243923_mirror-nc.png 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/80A6/production/_123243923_mirror-nc.png 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/80A6/production/_123243923_mirror-nc.png 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/80A6/production/_123243923_mirror-nc.png 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/80A6/production/_123243923_mirror-nc.png 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/80A6/production/_123243923_mirror-nc.png 976w\" width=\"976\"/></span></span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-5ccyy0-styledfigurecaption e34k3c22\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1f39n02-visuallyhidden e1y6uwnp0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-1yybcoc-stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\">&quot;Countdown to war&quot; is the headline on the front of the Daily Mirror which says last-ditch efforts to prevent an invasion are looking &quot;increasingly futile&quot; after the Russian leader sent more soldiers, helicopters and tanks to the border with Ukraine. Moscow could be planning an invasion &quot;at any moment&quot;, Downing Street said.</div></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ssrcss-18mjolk-componentwrapper e1xue1i89\" data-component=\"image-block\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-wpgbih-styledfigure e34k3c23\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-styledfigurecontainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-10pamqn-placeholder e16icw910\"><span><img alt=\"The Daily Mail front page 14 February 2022\" class=\"ssrcss-1drmwog-image ee0ct7c0\" height=\"1335\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/CADE/production/_123243915_mail-nc.png\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/CADE/production/_123243915_mail-nc.png 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/CADE/production/_123243915_mail-nc.png 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/CADE/production/_123243915_mail-nc.png 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/CADE/production/_123243915_mail-nc.png 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/CADE/production/_123243915_mail-nc.png 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/CADE/production/_123243915_mail-nc.png 976w\" width=\"976\"/></span></span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-5ccyy0-styledfigurecaption e34k3c22\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1f39n02-visuallyhidden e1y6uwnp0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-1yybcoc-stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\">&quot;Frantic 48 hours to save Europe from war,&quot; is the Daily Mail&apos;s headline as it describes the final diplomatic push to avert a war in Ukraine. The next two days are said to be crucial, the paper notes, with the PM going on a &quot;whistle-stop&quot; tour of Europe.</div></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ssrcss-18mjolk-componentwrapper e1xue1i89\" data-component=\"image-block\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-wpgbih-styledfigure e34k3c23\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-styledfigurecontainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-16ehvj7-placeholder e16icw910\"><span><img alt=\"The Daily Express front page 14 February 2022\" class=\"ssrcss-1drmwog-image ee0ct7c0\" height=\"1255\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/F1EE/production/_123243916_express-nc.png\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/F1EE/production/_123243916_express-nc.png 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/F1EE/production/_123243916_express-nc.png 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/F1EE/production/_123243916_express-nc.png 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/F1EE/production/_123243916_express-nc.png 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/F1EE/production/_123243916_express-nc.png 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/F1EE/production/_123243916_express-nc.png 976w\" width=\"976\"/></span></span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-5ccyy0-styledfigurecaption e34k3c22\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1f39n02-visuallyhidden e1y6uwnp0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-1yybcoc-stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\">Mr Johnson says the crisis is at a &quot;critical juncture&quot;, the Daily Express reports. It adds that Foreign Secretary Liz Truss is putting the finishing touches to a sanctions package designed to target Mr Putin&apos;s close associates, in the event of a Russian invasion.</div></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ssrcss-18mjolk-componentwrapper e1xue1i89\" data-component=\"image-block\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-wpgbih-styledfigure e34k3c23\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-styledfigurecontainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1tuiclk-placeholder e16icw910\"><span><img alt=\"Metro front page 14 February 2022\" class=\"ssrcss-1drmwog-image ee0ct7c0\" height=\"1240\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/118FE/production/_123243917_metro-nc.png\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/118FE/production/_123243917_metro-nc.png 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/118FE/production/_123243917_metro-nc.png 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/118FE/production/_123243917_metro-nc.png 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/118FE/production/_123243917_metro-nc.png 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/118FE/production/_123243917_metro-nc.png 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/118FE/production/_123243917_metro-nc.png 976w\" width=\"976\"/></span></span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-5ccyy0-styledfigurecaption e34k3c22\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1f39n02-visuallyhidden e1y6uwnp0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-1yybcoc-stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\">But Metro carries comments from one of Mr Putin&apos;s top officials, who has insisted that Moscow is not worried about the threat of sanctions. &quot;New sanctions are nothing positive but not as bad as the West makes it sound,&quot; Viktor Tatarintsev is quoted as saying.</div></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ssrcss-18mjolk-componentwrapper e1xue1i89\" data-component=\"image-block\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-wpgbih-styledfigure e34k3c23\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-styledfigurecontainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1hz75q1-placeholder e16icw910\"><span><img alt=\"The Financial Times front page 14 February 2022\" class=\"ssrcss-1drmwog-image ee0ct7c0\" height=\"1563\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/1400E/production/_123243918_ft-nc.png\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/1400E/production/_123243918_ft-nc.png 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/1400E/production/_123243918_ft-nc.png 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/1400E/production/_123243918_ft-nc.png 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/1400E/production/_123243918_ft-nc.png 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/1400E/production/_123243918_ft-nc.png 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/1400E/production/_123243918_ft-nc.png 976w\" width=\"976\"/></span></span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-5ccyy0-styledfigurecaption e34k3c22\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1f39n02-visuallyhidden e1y6uwnp0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-1yybcoc-stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\">Meanwhile, German Chancellor Olaf Scholz is due to travel to Kyiv for talks with Ukrainian leader Volodymyr Zelensky before meeting Mr Putin on Tuesday, the Financial Times says. The paper reports that one senior government official said Mr Scholz&apos;s aim was to &quot;get a better understanding of Russia&apos;s goals, and to try to figure out if there are any ways back to direct dialogue&quot;.</div></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ssrcss-18mjolk-componentwrapper e1xue1i89\" data-component=\"image-block\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-wpgbih-styledfigure e34k3c23\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-styledfigurecontainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1sn8azm-placeholder e16icw910\"><span><img alt=\"The Guardian front page 14 February 2022\" class=\"ssrcss-1drmwog-image ee0ct7c0\" height=\"1210\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/1671E/production/_123243919_guardian-nc.png\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/1671E/production/_123243919_guardian-nc.png 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/1671E/production/_123243919_guardian-nc.png 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/1671E/production/_123243919_guardian-nc.png 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/1671E/production/_123243919_guardian-nc.png 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/1671E/production/_123243919_guardian-nc.png 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/1671E/production/_123243919_guardian-nc.png 976w\" width=\"976\"/></span></span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-5ccyy0-styledfigurecaption e34k3c22\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1f39n02-visuallyhidden e1y6uwnp0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-1yybcoc-stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\">The Guardian says dozens of western diplomats in Kyiv are preparing to leave the city following warnings from several countries for citizens still inside Ukraine to get out. The paper reports the governments of 39 countries have warned against travel to Ukraine. In a separate story leading the front page, the Guardian says a &quot;damning&quot; race report has revealed the vast inequalities across healthcare. The paper says the 166-page report, due to be published in full this week, presents a &quot;devastating picture of a healthcare system still failing minority ethnic patients&quot;.</div></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ssrcss-18mjolk-componentwrapper e1xue1i89\" data-component=\"image-block\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-wpgbih-styledfigure e34k3c23\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-styledfigurecontainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1wjm2x5-placeholder e16icw910\"><span><img alt=\"The Daily Star front page 14 February 2022\" class=\"ssrcss-1drmwog-image ee0ct7c0\" height=\"1274\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/5996/production/_123243922_star-nc.png\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/5996/production/_123243922_star-nc.png 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/5996/production/_123243922_star-nc.png 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/5996/production/_123243922_star-nc.png 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/5996/production/_123243922_star-nc.png 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/5996/production/_123243922_star-nc.png 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/5996/production/_123243922_star-nc.png 976w\" width=\"976\"/></span></span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-5ccyy0-styledfigurecaption e34k3c22\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1f39n02-visuallyhidden e1y6uwnp0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-1yybcoc-stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\">Elsewhere, the Daily Star says four storms are due to &quot;hammer&quot; Britain this week, spoiling the half-term holiday for many. Winds will reach up to 100mph and torrential rain is set to batter Britain, according to the paper, which calls the upcoming week &quot;half-term helliday&quot;.</div></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ssrcss-18mjolk-componentwrapper e1xue1i89\" data-component=\"image-block\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-wpgbih-styledfigure e34k3c23\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-styledfigurecontainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-6bopp3-placeholder e16icw910\"><span><img alt=\"The Sun front page 14 February 2022\" class=\"ssrcss-1drmwog-image ee0ct7c0\" height=\"1265\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/0B76/production/_123243920_the-sun-nc.png\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/0B76/production/_123243920_the-sun-nc.png 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/0B76/production/_123243920_the-sun-nc.png 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/0B76/production/_123243920_the-sun-nc.png 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/0B76/production/_123243920_the-sun-nc.png 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/0B76/production/_123243920_the-sun-nc.png 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/0B76/production/_123243920_the-sun-nc.png 976w\" width=\"976\"/></span></span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-5ccyy0-styledfigurecaption e34k3c22\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1f39n02-visuallyhidden e1y6uwnp0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-1yybcoc-stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\">And the Sun carries allegations about deputy chief of the Royal Air Force, Andrew Turner.</div></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ssrcss-18mjolk-componentwrapper e1xue1i89\" data-component=\"image-block\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-wpgbih-styledfigure e34k3c23\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-styledfigurecontainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-11w4c8-placeholder e16icw910\"><span><img alt=\"BBC News Daily on Facebook Messenger\" class=\"ssrcss-1drmwog-image ee0ct7c0\" height=\"77\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/EC4F/production/_99659406_newsdailystrap.png\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/EC4F/production/_99659406_newsdailystrap.png 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/EC4F/production/_99659406_newsdailystrap.png 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/EC4F/production/_99659406_newsdailystrap.png 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/EC4F/production/_99659406_newsdailystrap.png 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/EC4F/production/_99659406_newsdailystrap.png 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/EC4F/production/_99659406_newsdailystrap.png 976w\" width=\"624\"/></span></span></div></figure></div><div class=\"ssrcss-uf6wea-richtextcomponentwrapper e1xue1i85\" data-component=\"text-block\"><div class=\"ssrcss-17j9f6r-richtextcontainer e5tfeyi1\"><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-paragraph eq5iqo00\"><a class=\"ssrcss-9nsdc6-inlinelink e1no5rhv0\" href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/newsletters/newsdaily/zhp28xs\">Sign up for a morning briefing direct to your inbox</a></p></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-18mjolk-componentwrapper e1xue1i89\" data-component=\"image-block\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-wpgbih-styledfigure e34k3c23\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-styledfigurecontainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-13a8epv-placeholder e16icw910\"><span><img alt=\"Red line\" class=\"ssrcss-1drmwog-image ee0ct7c0\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/1135F/production/_99659407_redline.png\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/1135F/production/_99659407_redline.png 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/1135F/production/_99659407_redline.png 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/1135F/production/_99659407_redline.png 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/1135F/production/_99659407_redline.png 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/1135F/production/_99659407_redline.png 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/976/cpsprodpb/1135F/production/_99659407_redline.png 976w\" width=\"624\"/></span></span></div></figure></div><div class=\"ssrcss-18mjolk-componentwrapper e1xue1i89\" data-component=\"image-block\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-wpgbih-s